WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.902
Arctic sovereignty.

00:00:01.852 --> 00:00:04.488
Canada can't patrol its own north.

00:00:04.488 --> 00:00:09.113
Russia operates over forty icebreakers including nuclear-powered vessels.

00:00:09.113 --> 00:00:13.852
China has declared itself a near-Arctic state and is building icebreakers.

00:00:13.852 --> 00:00:19.227
The United States does not recognise Canada's sovereignty claim over the Northwest Passage.

00:00:19.227 --> 00:00:30.749
Canada has two heavy icebreakers — one of which, the CCGS Louis S. St-Laurent, is over fifty years old and scheduled for replacement by the Polar-class icebreaker that is years behind schedule.

00:00:30.749 --> 00:00:34.318
Canada cannot patrol the Northwest Passage year-round.

00:00:34.318 --> 00:00:42.886
As Arctic ice melts and the passage becomes commercially viable, the countries that can operate in Arctic waters will control Arctic resources and shipping lanes.

00:00:42.886 --> 00:00:47.204
Canada claims sovereignty over the largest Arctic coastline in the world.

00:00:47.204 --> 00:00:49.534
It cannot enforce that claim.

00:00:49.534 --> 00:00:52.897
Comparison: Arctic capabilities by country.

00:00:52.897 --> 00:00:54.715
The sovereignty gap.

00:00:54.715 --> 00:00:59.113
Arctic sovereignty is the geographic expression of institutional capture.

00:00:59.113 --> 00:01:05.011
The military is degraded — as documented in the military purge and procurement failure analyses.

00:01:05.011 --> 00:01:08.340
Defence spending is last among NATO allies.

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:11.704
The Coast Guard has two aging heavy icebreakers.

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:14.795
Northern communities lack basic services.

00:01:14.795 --> 00:01:19.727
Russia operates forty-plus icebreakers and multiple Arctic military bases.

00:01:19.727 --> 00:01:22.590
China is building Arctic capability.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:25.954
The US doesn't even recognise Canada's claim.

00:01:25.954 --> 00:01:29.511
Canada claims the largest Arctic coastline in the world.

00:01:29.511 --> 00:01:39.977
It cannot enforce that claim because the institutions responsible for enforcement are captured, underfunded, and degraded by the same system documented across two hundred and forty-three pages on this site.
